# L §4.4, §2.3 (tally 2.3, #247; G3 under the plan's §12a): `one_of` is no form; a model's row that states it
# prints what an unknown call prints there, `LOAD-SCENARIO an expression row outside a scenario` (MIGRATION 2.2.1
# -> 2.3; the review of G3, Q5). Before G3: `one_of([2026-05-04, 2026-05-11])`.
=== m.tally
model oneof
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source card "invented"
input d: date
version v
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  d = one_of([2026-05-04, 2026-05-11]) "c"
ask a: d
=== expect
refused: LOAD-SCENARIO an expression row outside a scenario (m.tally:12)
